{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only 10 lives. 90 handcrafted levels. One brutal challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is a distilled arcade-puzzle experience built entirely around <strong>mastery and survival</strong>. You start with just 10 lives \u2014 and that\u2019s all you\u2019ll ever get. Lose them all, and it\u2019s back to the very beginning. No extra continues. No shortcuts. Just pure challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is simple: guide a small crystal orb along intricate paths and <strong>collect every gold piece in each level</strong>. The moment all gold is collected, the level ends. But one wrong click, one mistimed jump, and you\u2019re out. With every mistake, your precious pool of lives shrinks. Can you survive all 90 levels in a single run?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Lives Total</strong> \u2013 A single pool of lives for the entire game. Run out, and it\u2019s game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90 Handcrafted Levels</strong> \u2013 From introductory stages to near-impossible final trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls, Impossible Difficulty</strong> \u2013 One button, infinite ways to fail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Challenges</strong> \u2013 Time-limited stages, move-limited puzzles, disappearing platforms, moving hazards, portals, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pause &amp; Resume</strong> \u2013 Take a break, but when you return, your remaining lives and progress are exactly where you left them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards &amp; Achievements</strong> \u2013 Compete globally: who gets furthest, with the most lives, in the fastest time?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collector: 10 Lives Challenge is not about grinding, upgrades, or random luck. It\u2019s about <strong>learning patterns, refining your timing, and pushing your limits</strong> until you finally conquer the impossible. Each run is a test of focus and resilience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ten lives. One chance. Can you beat the challenge?</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Flawless 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/734415042a92f7c47ccd1d0f03d6045e9d8f1c9a.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless 30","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/02b6adec8bfe94f60566aa53909dcd55df9bad67.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless 50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/c76baa122608bc78a220be884ca2c15e872dff14.jpg"},{"name":"The Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/cbff8ad0b731e0bc380030ae37ff370d690e41fb.jpg"},{"name":"The Impossible","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/3015e31e043f847c39eb91f9899e24f759e09b67.jpg"},{"name":"Ooops!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/1cada16b826eb5e46874492892f839312f562a5d.jpg"},{"name":"Death Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/bbff85430b63ed0ca6a5d3a462d13a4757f340c1.jpg"},{"name":"The Endless Challenger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/cff8f354199e3a0ad0c3588aa3548f6b8af05231.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Milestone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/50dfb32e4a52382664b17d1f8c34b00cc86fbbbf.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Hard Zone","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4054150/337e91ff1d0ffeaddc8edb9a5fb1d50fb5201217.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/st